{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BNSXpGNBJNhNoRdbHzPBbb","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"4:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"4111\">\n    <frame id=\"4:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"176\">\n      <text id=\"4:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"20\" />\n      <text id=\"4:5\" name=\"Fruit Hub — fruit salad ordering app\" x=\"0\" y=\"32\" width=\"1312\" height=\"54\" />\n      <text id=\"4:6\" name=\"Design the complete Fruit Hub mobile app: Tony tells the app their first name, browses fruit salad combos, adds one to the basket, checks out with delivery details or a card, and tracks the delivery. Canvas 375 × 812, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"98\" width=\"1312\" height=\"78\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"288\" width=\"1312\" height=\"259\">\n      <text id=\"4:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"4:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 10 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / warning / disabled, supporting colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the sheets and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the logo, product photos, illustrations, map and icons from 04 · Media. Prices use the Naira glyph (Icon_Naira or “₦”). 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"207\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"595\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1895\">\n      <text id=\"4:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"4:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1804\">\n        <frame id=\"4:14\" name=\"01_Splash\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"224\">\n          <text id=\"4:15\" name=\"01_Splash\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"90\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"4:16\" name=\"Goal: Brand recognition while the app loads.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:18\" name=\"• Brand: Logo_Fruit_Hub\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"151\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:20\" name=\"→ auto → 02_Welcome\" x=\"25\" y=\"178\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:21\" name=\"02_Welcome\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"287\">\n          <text id=\"4:22\" name=\"02_Welcome\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"115\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"4:23\" name=\"Goal: Explain the offer and start.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:25\" name=\"• Actions: Let’s Continue • Copy: “Get The Freshest Fruit Salad Combo” · “We deliver the best and freshest fruit salad in town. Order for a combo today!!!” • Media: Basket_Welcome · Fruit_Drops\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"84\" />\n          <text id=\"4:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"214\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:27\" name=\"→ Let’s Continue → 03_Name\" x=\"25\" y=\"241\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:28\" name=\"03_Name\" x=\"0\" y=\"311\" width=\"644\" height=\"287\">\n          <text id=\"4:29\" name=\"03_Name\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"84\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"4:30\" name=\"Goal: Tell the app your first name.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:32\" name=\"• Actions: Start Ordering • Copy: “What is your firstname?” • Form: first name, entered “Tony” • Media: Basket_Name · Fruit_Drops\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"84\" />\n          <text id=\"4:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"214\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:34\" name=\"→ Start Ordering → 04_Home\" x=\"25\" y=\"241\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:35\" name=\"04_Home\" x=\"668\" y=\"311\" width=\"644\" height=\"392\">\n          <text id=\"4:36\" name=\"04_Home\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"85\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"4:37\" name=\"Goal: Find a fruit salad combo.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:39\" name=\"• Account: “Hello Tony, What fruit salad combo do you want today?” · menu entry · My basket entry • Categories: Hottest / Popular / New combo / Top · current: Hottest • Hottest: Quinoa fruit salad · Tropical fruit salad · Melon fruit salad, each with photo, name, price, favourite toggle and add to basket • Recommended: “Recommended Combo” · Honey lime combo · Berry mango combo, each with photo, name, price, favourite toggle and add to basket • Search &amp; filter: search “Search for fruit salad combos” · filter entry\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"168\" />\n          <text id=\"4:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"298\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:41\" name=\"→ Quinoa fruit salad → 05_Product_Quinoa → My basket → 06_Basket\" x=\"25\" y=\"325\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:42\" name=\"05_Product_Quinoa\" x=\"0\" y=\"727\" width=\"644\" height=\"371\">\n          <text id=\"4:43\" name=\"05_Product_Quinoa\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"174\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"4:44\" name=\"Goal: Choose a quantity and add the combo to the basket.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:45\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:46\" name=\"• Actions: Go back · favourite toggle · Add to basket • Contents: “One Pack Contains:” · Red Quinoa, Lime, Honey, Blueberries, Strawberries, Mango, Fresh mint. • Copy: “Quinoa Fruit Salad” · “If you are looking for a new fruit salad to eat today, quinoa is the perfect brunch for you.” • Media: Salad_Quinoa • Quantity: 1 pack, can be decreased / increased · price ₦10,000\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"147\" />\n          <text id=\"4:47\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"277\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:48\" name=\"→ Go back → 04_Home → Add to basket → 06_Basket\" x=\"25\" y=\"304\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:49\" name=\"06_Basket\" x=\"668\" y=\"727\" width=\"644\" height=\"329\">\n          <text id=\"4:50\" name=\"06_Basket\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"93\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"4:51\" name=\"Goal: Review the basket and check out.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:52\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:53\" name=\"• Actions: Go back · Checkout • Copy: “My Basket” • Items: Quinoa fruit salad · Melon fruit salad · Tropical fruit salad, each with photo, name, “2 packs” and ₦20,000 • Total: “Total” ₦60,000\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"105\" />\n          <text id=\"4:54\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"235\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:55\" name=\"→ Go back → 04_Home → Checkout → 07_Checkout_Delivery\" x=\"25\" y=\"262\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:56\" name=\"07_Checkout_Delivery\" x=\"0\" y=\"1122\" width=\"644\" height=\"329\">\n          <text id=\"4:57\" name=\"07_Checkout_Delivery\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"195\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"4:58\" name=\"Goal: Give delivery details and choose how to pay.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:59\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:60\" name=\"• Actions: close · Pay on delivery · Pay with card • Delivery: “Delivery address” 10th avenue, Lekki, Lagos State · “Number we can call” 09090605708 · both filled in • Presentation: opens over 06_Basket; the basket stays behind it\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"84\" />\n          <text id=\"4:61\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"214\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:62\" name=\"→ close → 06_Basket → Pay with card → 08_Checkout_Card → Pay on delivery → 09_Order_Complete\" x=\"25\" y=\"241\" width=\"594\" height=\"63\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:63\" name=\"08_Checkout_Card\" x=\"668\" y=\"1122\" width=\"644\" height=\"308\">\n          <text id=\"4:64\" name=\"08_Checkout_Card\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"168\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"4:65\" name=\"Goal: Pay by card.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:66\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:67\" name=\"• Actions: close · Complete Order • Card: “Card Holder’s Name” Tony Chris · “Card Number” 1234 5678 9012 1314 · “Date” 10/30 · “CVV” 123 · all filled in • Presentation: opens over 06_Basket; the basket stays behind it\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"84\" />\n          <text id=\"4:68\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"214\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:69\" name=\"→ close → 06_Basket → Complete Order → 09_Order_Complete\" x=\"25\" y=\"241\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:70\" name=\"09_Order_Complete\" x=\"0\" y=\"1475\" width=\"644\" height=\"287\">\n          <text id=\"4:71\" name=\"09_Order_Complete\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"176\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"4:72\" name=\"Goal: Confirm the order was placed.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:73\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:74\" name=\"• Actions: Track order · Continue shopping • Copy: “Congratulations!!!” · “Your order has been taken and is being attended to” • Status: success mark (Icon_Success_Check)\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"63\" />\n          <text id=\"4:75\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"193\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:76\" name=\"→ Track order → 10_Track_Order → Continue shopping → 04_Home\" x=\"25\" y=\"220\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:77\" name=\"10_Track_Order\" x=\"668\" y=\"1475\" width=\"644\" height=\"329\">\n          <text id=\"4:78\" name=\"10_Track_Order\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"136\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"4:79\" name=\"Goal: Follow the delivery.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:80\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:81\" name=\"• Actions: Go back · call the delivery agent • Copy: “Delivery Status” • Map: Map_Delivery • Steps, in this order: Order Taken (done, Step_Order_Taken) · Order Is Being Prepared (done, Step_Order_Prepared) · Order Is Being Delivered (current, “Your delivery agent is coming”, Step_Order_Delivering) · Order Received (not yet)\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"126\" />\n          <text id=\"4:82\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"256\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:83\" name=\"→ Go back → 04_Home\" x=\"25\" y=\"283\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:84\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"2538\" width=\"1312\" height=\"167\">\n      <text id=\"4:85\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"4:86\" name=\"• One linear flow, no bottom navigation: 01_Splash → 02_Welcome → 03_Name → 04_Home → 05_Product_Quinoa → 06_Basket → 07_Checkout_Delivery → 08_Checkout_Card → 09_Order_Complete → 10_Track_Order. • 07 and 08 are sheets over the basket (one frame each). 07 can skip the card step: Pay on delivery → 09. • Pushed screens with Go back: 05, 06, 10. • Entry only (no frame): menu, search, filter, categories other than Hottest, favourite toggles, add-to-basket on Home, combos other than Quinoa, call agent.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"115\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:87\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"2753\" width=\"1312\" height=\"626\">\n      <text id=\"4:88\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"4:89\" name=\"Use these values verbatim. Currency Nigerian Naira (₦).\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:90\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1312\" height=\"535\">\n        <frame id=\"4:91\" name=\"Customer\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"89\">\n          <text id=\"4:92\" name=\"Customer\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"68\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:93\" name=\"First name Tony (entered on 03_Name; greeting on 04_Home)\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:94\" name=\"Combos (name · price · photo)\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"169\">\n          <text id=\"4:95\" name=\"Combos (name · price · photo)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"207\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:96\" name=\"Honey lime combo · ₦2,000 · Salad_Honey_Lime Berry mango combo · ₦8,000 · Salad_Berry_Mango Quinoa fruit salad · ₦10,000 · Salad_Quinoa Tropical fruit salad · ₦10,000 · Salad_Tropical Melon fruit salad · ₦10,000 · Salad_Melon\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"100\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:97\" name=\"Home sections\" x=\"888\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"129\">\n          <text id=\"4:98\" name=\"Home sections\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"103\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:99\" name=\"Recommended Combo: Honey lime, Berry mango Categories: Hottest (current) / Popular / New combo / Top Hottest: Quinoa, Tropical, Melon\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"60\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:100\" name=\"Quinoa Fruit Salad\" x=\"0\" y=\"193\" width=\"420\" height=\"169\">\n          <text id=\"4:101\" name=\"Quinoa Fruit Salad\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"126\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:102\" name=\"One Pack Contains: Red Quinoa, Lime, Honey, Blueberries, Strawberries, Mango, Fresh mint. “If you are looking for a new fruit salad to eat today, quinoa is the perfect brunch for you.” Quantity 1 · ₦10,000\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"100\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:103\" name=\"My Basket\" x=\"444\" y=\"193\" width=\"420\" height=\"149\">\n          <text id=\"4:104\" name=\"My Basket\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"72\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:105\" name=\"Quinoa fruit salad · 2 packs · ₦20,000 Melon fruit salad · 2 packs · ₦20,000 Tropical fruit salad · 2 packs · ₦20,000 Total ₦60,000\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"80\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:106\" name=\"Delivery\" x=\"888\" y=\"193\" width=\"420\" height=\"129\">\n          <text id=\"4:107\" name=\"Delivery\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"57\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:108\" name=\"Delivery address: 10th avenue, Lekki, Lagos State Number we can call: 09090605708 Options: Pay on delivery · Pay with card\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"60\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:109\" name=\"Card\" x=\"0\" y=\"386\" width=\"420\" height=\"149\">\n          <text id=\"4:110\" name=\"Card\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"33\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:111\" name=\"Card Holder’s Name: Tony Chris Card Number: 1234 5678 9012 1314 Date: 10/30 · CVV: 123 Button: Complete Order\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"80\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:112\" name=\"Order complete\" x=\"444\" y=\"386\" width=\"420\" height=\"129\">\n          <text id=\"4:113\" name=\"Order complete\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"107\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:114\" name=\"“Congratulations!!!” “Your order has been taken and is being attended to” Track order · Continue shopping\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"60\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:115\" name=\"Delivery status\" x=\"888\" y=\"386\" width=\"420\" height=\"129\">\n          <text id=\"4:116\" name=\"Delivery status\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"104\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:117\" name=\"Order Taken ✓ · Order Is Being Prepared ✓ · Order Is Being Delivered (now) “Your delivery agent is coming” · Order Received (pending)\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"60\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:118\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"3427\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"4:119\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"36\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:120\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"229\">\n        <frame id=\"4:121\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"229\">\n          <text id=\"4:122\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"4:123\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand primary color #FFA451 + Nunito • Media: logo, product photos, illustrations, map, icons • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\" x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"596\" height=\"147\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:124\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"208\">\n          <text id=\"4:125\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"4:126\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, semantic and supporting colors • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: selected, favourited, pressed, disabled, filled, done / current / pending • Headers, sheets and all business components • How the step progress and the map are presented\" x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"596\" height=\"126\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:127\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"3756\" width=\"1312\" height=\"291\">\n      <text id=\"4:128\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"4:129\" name=\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n      <text id=\"4:130\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current category, filled fields, sheet over basket, done / current / pending steps)\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1312\" height=\"161\" />\n      <text id=\"4:131\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 10 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"268\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"699ed9aa-c6dd-440c-b26c-c32602e1a158","uuid":"a304058f-58eb-4cf9-baac-ef9223a97b2c","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:17:26.002Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"4:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"4111\">\n    <frame id=\"4:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"176\">\n      <text id=\"4:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"20\" />\n      <text id=\"4:5\" name=\"Fruit Hub — fruit salad ordering app\" x=\"0\" y=\"32\" width=\"1312\" height=\"54\" />\n      <text id=\"4:6\" name=\"Design the complete Fruit Hub mobile app: Tony tells the app their first name, browses fruit salad combos, adds one to the basket, checks out with delivery details or a card, and tracks the delivery. Canvas 375 × 812, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"98\" width=\"1312\" height=\"78\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"288\" width=\"1312\" height=\"259\">\n      <text id=\"4:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"4:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 10 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / warning / disabled, supporting colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the sheets and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the logo, product photos, illustrations, map and icons from 04 · Media. Prices use the Naira glyph (Icon_Naira or “₦”). 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"207\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"595\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1895\">\n      <text id=\"4:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"4:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1804\">\n        <frame id=\"4:14\" name=\"01_Splash\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"224\">\n          <text id=\"4:15\" name=\"01_Splash\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"90\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"4:16\" name=\"Goal: Brand recognition while the app loads.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:18\" name=\"• Brand: Logo_Fruit_Hub\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"151\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:20\" name=\"→ auto → 02_Welcome\" x=\"25\" y=\"178\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:21\" name=\"02_Welcome\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"287\">\n          <text id=\"4:22\" name=\"02_Welcome\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"115\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"4:23\" name=\"Goal: Explain the offer and start.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:25\" name=\"• Actions: Let’s Continue • Copy: “Get The Freshest Fruit Salad Combo” · “We deliver the best and freshest fruit salad in town. Order for a combo today!!!” • Media: Basket_Welcome · Fruit_Drops\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"84\" />\n          <text id=\"4:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"214\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:27\" name=\"→ Let’s Continue → 03_Name\" x=\"25\" y=\"241\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:28\" name=\"03_Name\" x=\"0\" y=\"311\" width=\"644\" height=\"287\">\n          <text id=\"4:29\" name=\"03_Name\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"84\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"4:30\" name=\"Goal: Tell the app your first name.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:32\" name=\"• Actions: Start Ordering • Copy: “What is your firstname?” • Form: first name, entered “Tony” • Media: Basket_Name · Fruit_Drops\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"84\" />\n          <text id=\"4:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"214\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:34\" name=\"→ Start Ordering → 04_Home\" x=\"25\" y=\"241\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:35\" name=\"04_Home\" x=\"668\" y=\"311\" width=\"644\" height=\"392\">\n          <text id=\"4:36\" name=\"04_Home\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"85\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"4:37\" name=\"Goal: Find a fruit salad combo.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:39\" name=\"• Account: “Hello Tony, What fruit salad combo do you want today?” · menu entry · My basket entry • Categories: Hottest / Popular / New combo / Top · current: Hottest • Hottest: Quinoa fruit salad · Tropical fruit salad · Melon fruit salad, each with photo, name, price, favourite toggle and add to basket • Recommended: “Recommended Combo” · Honey lime combo · Berry mango combo, each with photo, name, price, favourite toggle and add to basket • Search &amp; filter: search “Search for fruit salad combos” · filter entry\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"168\" />\n          <text id=\"4:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"298\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:41\" name=\"→ Quinoa fruit salad → 05_Product_Quinoa → My basket → 06_Basket\" x=\"25\" y=\"325\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:42\" name=\"05_Product_Quinoa\" x=\"0\" y=\"727\" width=\"644\" height=\"371\">\n          <text id=\"4:43\" name=\"05_Product_Quinoa\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"174\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"4:44\" name=\"Goal: Choose a quantity and add the combo to the basket.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:45\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:46\" name=\"• Actions: Go back · favourite toggle · Add to basket • Contents: “One Pack Contains:” · Red Quinoa, Lime, Honey, Blueberries, Strawberries, Mango, Fresh mint. • Copy: “Quinoa Fruit Salad” · “If you are looking for a new fruit salad to eat today, quinoa is the perfect brunch for you.” • Media: Salad_Quinoa • Quantity: 1 pack, can be decreased / increased · price ₦10,000\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"147\" />\n          <text id=\"4:47\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"277\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:48\" name=\"→ Go back → 04_Home → Add to basket → 06_Basket\" x=\"25\" y=\"304\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:49\" name=\"06_Basket\" x=\"668\" y=\"727\" width=\"644\" height=\"329\">\n          <text id=\"4:50\" name=\"06_Basket\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"93\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"4:51\" name=\"Goal: Review the basket and check out.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:52\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:53\" name=\"• Actions: Go back · Checkout • Copy: “My Basket” • Items: Quinoa fruit salad · Melon fruit salad · Tropical fruit salad, each with photo, name, “2 packs” and ₦20,000 • Total: “Total” ₦60,000\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"105\" />\n          <text id=\"4:54\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"235\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:55\" name=\"→ Go back → 04_Home → Checkout → 07_Checkout_Delivery\" x=\"25\" y=\"262\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:56\" name=\"07_Checkout_Delivery\" x=\"0\" y=\"1122\" width=\"644\" height=\"329\">\n          <text id=\"4:57\" name=\"07_Checkout_Delivery\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"195\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"4:58\" name=\"Goal: Give delivery details and choose how to pay.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:59\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:60\" name=\"• Actions: close · Pay on delivery · Pay with card • Delivery: “Delivery address” 10th avenue, Lekki, Lagos State · “Number we can call” 09090605708 · both filled in • Presentation: opens over 06_Basket; the basket stays behind it\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"84\" />\n          <text id=\"4:61\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"214\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:62\" name=\"→ close → 06_Basket → Pay with card → 08_Checkout_Card → Pay on delivery → 09_Order_Complete\" x=\"25\" y=\"241\" width=\"594\" height=\"63\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:63\" name=\"08_Checkout_Card\" x=\"668\" y=\"1122\" width=\"644\" height=\"308\">\n          <text id=\"4:64\" name=\"08_Checkout_Card\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"168\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"4:65\" name=\"Goal: Pay by card.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:66\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:67\" name=\"• Actions: close · Complete Order • Card: “Card Holder’s Name” Tony Chris · “Card Number” 1234 5678 9012 1314 · “Date” 10/30 · “CVV” 123 · all filled in • Presentation: opens over 06_Basket; the basket stays behind it\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"84\" />\n          <text id=\"4:68\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"214\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:69\" name=\"→ close → 06_Basket → Complete Order → 09_Order_Complete\" x=\"25\" y=\"241\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:70\" name=\"09_Order_Complete\" x=\"0\" y=\"1475\" width=\"644\" height=\"287\">\n          <text id=\"4:71\" name=\"09_Order_Complete\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"176\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"4:72\" name=\"Goal: Confirm the order was placed.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:73\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:74\" name=\"• Actions: Track order · Continue shopping • Copy: “Congratulations!!!” · “Your order has been taken and is being attended to” • Status: success mark (Icon_Success_Check)\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"63\" />\n          <text id=\"4:75\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"193\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:76\" name=\"→ Track order → 10_Track_Order → Continue shopping → 04_Home\" x=\"25\" y=\"220\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:77\" name=\"10_Track_Order\" x=\"668\" y=\"1475\" width=\"644\" height=\"329\">\n          <text id=\"4:78\" name=\"10_Track_Order\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"136\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"4:79\" name=\"Goal: Follow the delivery.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:80\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:81\" name=\"• Actions: Go back · call the delivery agent • Copy: “Delivery Status” • Map: Map_Delivery • Steps, in this order: Order Taken (done, Step_Order_Taken) · Order Is Being Prepared (done, Step_Order_Prepared) · Order Is Being Delivered (current, “Your delivery agent is coming”, Step_Order_Delivering) · Order Received (not yet)\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"126\" />\n          <text id=\"4:82\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"256\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:83\" name=\"→ Go back → 04_Home\" x=\"25\" y=\"283\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:84\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"2538\" width=\"1312\" height=\"167\">\n      <text id=\"4:85\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"4:86\" name=\"• One linear flow, no bottom navigation: 01_Splash → 02_Welcome → 03_Name → 04_Home → 05_Product_Quinoa → 06_Basket → 07_Checkout_Delivery → 08_Checkout_Card → 09_Order_Complete → 10_Track_Order. • 07 and 08 are sheets over the basket (one frame each). 07 can skip the card step: Pay on delivery → 09. • Pushed screens with Go back: 05, 06, 10. • Entry only (no frame): menu, search, filter, categories other than Hottest, favourite toggles, add-to-basket on Home, combos other than Quinoa, call agent.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"115\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:87\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"2753\" width=\"1312\" height=\"626\">\n      <text id=\"4:88\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"4:89\" name=\"Use these values verbatim. Currency Nigerian Naira (₦).\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:90\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1312\" height=\"535\">\n        <frame id=\"4:91\" name=\"Customer\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"89\">\n          <text id=\"4:92\" name=\"Customer\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"68\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:93\" name=\"First name Tony (entered on 03_Name; greeting on 04_Home)\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:94\" name=\"Combos (name · price · photo)\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"169\">\n          <text id=\"4:95\" name=\"Combos (name · price · photo)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"207\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:96\" name=\"Honey lime combo · ₦2,000 · Salad_Honey_Lime Berry mango combo · ₦8,000 · Salad_Berry_Mango Quinoa fruit salad · ₦10,000 · Salad_Quinoa Tropical fruit salad · ₦10,000 · Salad_Tropical Melon fruit salad · ₦10,000 · Salad_Melon\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"100\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:97\" name=\"Home sections\" x=\"888\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"129\">\n          <text id=\"4:98\" name=\"Home sections\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"103\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:99\" name=\"Recommended Combo: Honey lime, Berry mango Categories: Hottest (current) / Popular / New combo / Top Hottest: Quinoa, Tropical, Melon\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"60\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:100\" name=\"Quinoa Fruit Salad\" x=\"0\" y=\"193\" width=\"420\" height=\"169\">\n          <text id=\"4:101\" name=\"Quinoa Fruit Salad\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"126\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:102\" name=\"One Pack Contains: Red Quinoa, Lime, Honey, Blueberries, Strawberries, Mango, Fresh mint. “If you are looking for a new fruit salad to eat today, quinoa is the perfect brunch for you.” Quantity 1 · ₦10,000\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"100\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:103\" name=\"My Basket\" x=\"444\" y=\"193\" width=\"420\" height=\"149\">\n          <text id=\"4:104\" name=\"My Basket\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"72\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:105\" name=\"Quinoa fruit salad · 2 packs · ₦20,000 Melon fruit salad · 2 packs · ₦20,000 Tropical fruit salad · 2 packs · ₦20,000 Total ₦60,000\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"80\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:106\" name=\"Delivery\" x=\"888\" y=\"193\" width=\"420\" height=\"129\">\n          <text id=\"4:107\" name=\"Delivery\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"57\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:108\" name=\"Delivery address: 10th avenue, Lekki, Lagos State Number we can call: 09090605708 Options: Pay on delivery · Pay with card\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"60\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:109\" name=\"Card\" x=\"0\" y=\"386\" width=\"420\" height=\"149\">\n          <text id=\"4:110\" name=\"Card\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"33\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:111\" name=\"Card Holder’s Name: Tony Chris Card Number: 1234 5678 9012 1314 Date: 10/30 · CVV: 123 Button: Complete Order\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"80\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:112\" name=\"Order complete\" x=\"444\" y=\"386\" width=\"420\" height=\"129\">\n          <text id=\"4:113\" name=\"Order complete\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"107\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:114\" name=\"“Congratulations!!!” “Your order has been taken and is being attended to” Track order · Continue shopping\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"60\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:115\" name=\"Delivery status\" x=\"888\" y=\"386\" width=\"420\" height=\"129\">\n          <text id=\"4:116\" name=\"Delivery status\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"104\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:117\" name=\"Order Taken ✓ · Order Is Being Prepared ✓ · Order Is Being Delivered (now) “Your delivery agent is coming” · Order Received (pending)\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"60\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:118\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"3427\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"4:119\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"36\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:120\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"229\">\n        <frame id=\"4:121\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"229\">\n          <text id=\"4:122\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"4:123\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand primary color #FFA451 + Nunito • Media: logo, product photos, illustrations, map, icons • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\" x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"596\" height=\"147\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:124\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"208\">\n          <text id=\"4:125\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"4:126\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, semantic and supporting colors • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: selected, favourited, pressed, disabled, filled, done / current / pending • Headers, sheets and all business components • How the step progress and the map are presented\" x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"596\" height=\"126\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:127\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"3756\" width=\"1312\" height=\"291\">\n      <text id=\"4:128\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"4:129\" name=\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n      <text id=\"4:130\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current category, filled fields, sheet over basket, done / current / pending steps)\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1312\" height=\"161\" />\n      <text id=\"4:131\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 10 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"268\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"be15cf63-aa59-4bbc-89ef-c167a0080762"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01BNSXpGNBJNhNoRdbHzPBbb","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
