{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJvDcGc27Ms5OOSX25ua","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to work through the build plan for the fruit-salad app: the remaining unknown is the visual look of the media symbols, which I can verify by inspecting the reference pages visually, and I don't strictly need more info since image fills exist and I can copy those fills. I also verify the fonts available (Nunito styles) inside the build script via loadFontAsync for weights.\n\nThe workspace page (03) has no frames, so I build the design system first: component sets for \"Button/Secondary\", \"Button/Disabled\", header, product card, basket row, stepper, step indicators, and sheet, reusing the given Button and Text Field by creating instances and modifying text. The 10 screens sit at 375x812, laid out in a row/grid.\n\nColors: Brand #FFA451; text primary #27214D; secondary #5D577E or #8684A8; page bg #FFFFFF; card surface #FFF7F0 / #FFF9F5; success #4CD964; error #FF5A5F; warning #FFB800; disabled #E8E5E1; neutral surface #F4F1F1. Type scale in Nunito: H1 28/36 Bold; H2 22/30 Bold; H3 18/26 SemiBold; Body 16/24 Regular; BodyS 14/22; Caption 12/18. The wordmark uses Bad Script only inside the logo image.\n\nPer screen: 01_Splash has brand color bg, centered logo (152x118, scaled to ~220 wide), and auto-advances to 02 after 2000ms. 02_Welcome uses cream #FFF7F0, Basket_Welcome near top, Fruit_Drops accent, 28 Bold headline \"Get The Freshest Fruit Salad Combo\", body copy, and a Button \"Let's Continue\" (instance of 3:25, text resized). 03_Name has Basket_Name, \"What is your firstname?\", Text Field filled \"Tony\", and Start Ordering. 04_Home stacks status bar, header (menu icon in circle, \"Hello Tony,\" / \"What fruit salad combo do you want today?\", basket icon with badge), search row, category chips (Hottest current, Popular, New combo, Top), 3 hottest cards, and 2 recommended cards: roughly 110 + 56 + 40 + 30 + 288 + 40 + 192 ≈ 750, tight but feasible in 812. 05_Product_Quinoa has large image, back and favourite buttons, white sheet with title, \"One Pack Contains:\" list, description quote, stepper, price, Add to basket. 06_Basket has \"My Basket\", three rows, total row, Checkout. 07_Checkout_Delivery and 08_Checkout_Card overlay the basket via a \"Basket Content\" component instance, with filled fields, Pay on delivery / Pay with card, and Complete Order. 09_Order_Complete has success check, \"Congratulations!!!\", Track order and Continue shopping. 10_Track_Order has header, map image, and Delivery Status steps.\n\nPrototype reactions use TRIGGER_ON_CLICK → NAVIGATE, with AFTER_TIMEOUT on splash. I verify with screenshots at the end and fix.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":8689,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":25698,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":8689}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"699ed9aa-c6dd-440c-b26c-c32602e1a158","uuid":"34a6e849-70aa-4951-b0bc-185bda947c21","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:19:18.209Z","thinking_duration_ms":72025}
