{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJvLskJPpRAcv0Win1EE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to work out how to build 10 screens at 375x812 in the workspace, reusing the reference-page media components and adding prototype connections. I start from the constraint that the media symbols are COMPONENTs with IMAGE fills: I create instances of those components in my workspace frames, and because the image fill uses scaleMode FIT, an instance resizes cleanly with `instance.resize(w,h)`. I confirm resizing instances is allowed, and that hardcoded child colors (for example the Icon_Heart stroke in brand color) stay intact through instancing. To judge placement I want to actually see the media, and with enableBase64Response:true get_screenshot returns an inline base64 image entry I can view, which I use for verification.\n\nMy first concrete decision is the layout budget. The canvas is 375 wide, so content margins of 24 give a 327-wide card or button, and a two-card row at margin 20 with width 160 and gap 15 sums to 20 + 160 + 15 + 160 + 20 = 375. For 04_Home I stack the status bar at y0-44, a menu/basket row at y=56 h=44, the greeting \"Hello Tony,\" at y=110 in 24 ExtraBold with 14 Regular subcopy, a search row at y=186 h=56 (Icon_Search plus the placeholder \"Search for fruit salad combos\", and a 56x56 filter button), chips at y=258 h=40 (Hottest 74, Popular 76, New combo 94, Top 56, total 300 plus 3 gaps of 8 = 324), Hottest rows at h=76 with gap 8 from y=286 to 530, a Recommended label at 546, and two 160x180 combo cards from y=566 to 746, leaving the home indicator at 778-812.\n\nThe palette is brand #FFA451, ink #27214D, ink2 #5D577E, muted #9A95B5, soft surface #FFF7F0, and line #EFE8E1, all in Nunito at radii 16 to 24. The component library I build in one call: ProductCard 327x76 (60x60 image at x=10 y=8, name 15 Bold at 84,14, price at 84,42, heart at 271,16, add at 290,40), ComboCard 160x180, BasketRow 327x84 (56 image, name at 70,18, \"2 packs\" at 70,42, \"₦20,000\" right-aligned), Step/Done and Step/Pending at h=64 plus Step/Current at h=88 with a call button, Chip/Selected and Chip/Default, Stepper 120x44, SearchField 327x56, FilterButton 56x56, and icon-button components Menu, BasketBadge, Back, Close, Favourite(off) and Favourite(on).\n\nFor primary CTAs I instance the given Button at 3:25 via `await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(\"3:25\")` and `.createInstance()`, keeping width 327, and I set child constraints to horizontal STRETCH so text recenters on resize. For 07 and 08 I use `06_Basket.clone()` so the basket stays behind the dim overlay, then attach the delivery sheet and card sheet over it. Prototype links include the splash auto-advance at 2000ms.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":1193,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":41231,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1193}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"699ed9aa-c6dd-440c-b26c-c32602e1a158","uuid":"84a7a755-297c-4096-a71f-41574f60822c","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:21:13.512Z","thinking_duration_ms":86232}
