{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJwQKlZ8PID5GF8THHPj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for a fix to 04_Home: the second combo card shows \"Honey lime combo / ₦2,000\" because patching the component reset instance text overrides, the heart glyph is invisible (♡ too light/small), and the combo card name/price duplicates for Berry mango. The prototype wiring call returned \"Code executed with no return value\", so I verify reactions exist. I do fixes in one call and re-verify reactions in the same script, reporting the reaction summary. For the heart, Font Nunito may lack ♡, so I replace the glyph text in the component Heart frame with an Icon_Heart instance sized 15x14, recolored brand, and set each instance's Name/Price. The row cards' hearts are Icon_Heart vectors and render fine. The Add frames show plain orange circles, so I rebuild the plus with explicit 12px bars.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3202,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":130145,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3202}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"699ed9aa-c6dd-440c-b26c-c32602e1a158","uuid":"c3506065-36ed-4d32-9adf-e923db38e27e","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:33:31.696Z","thinking_duration_ms":13407}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJwQKlZ8PID5GF8THHPj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Private list: 04_Home needs three fixes (both combo cards still read \"Honey lime combo\"/₦2,000 because rebuilding the component reset the instance overrides, the ♡ glyph does not render, and the add buttons look like plain orange dots), and I must confirm the prototype reactions actually applied since that call returned no value. The fixes and the reaction verification are independent, so both go now."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3202,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":130145,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3202}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"699ed9aa-c6dd-440c-b26c-c32602e1a158","uuid":"c9518e3c-0e56-48e2-b175-4834632312a3","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:33:34.031Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJwQKlZ8PID5GF8THHPj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01kMTm8gFiE2XSV6iplqJoMd","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const ws=figma.root.children.find(p=>p.name.indexOf(\"03\")===0);\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(ws);\nconst C={ink:\"#27214D\",ink2:\"#5D577E\",brand:\"#FFA451\",white:\"#FFFFFF\"};\nconst hex=h=>{h=h.replace(\"#\",\"\");return{r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255}};\nconst sol=(h,o=1)=>({type:\"SOLID\",color:hex(h),opacity:o});\nconst F=s=>({family:\"Nunito\",style:s});\nfor(const s of[\"Regular\",\"Medium\",\"SemiBold\",\"Bold\",\"ExtraBold\"]){await figma.loadFontAsync(F(s));}\nfunction R(p,x,y,w,h,r,fill){const n=figma.createRectangle();p.appendChild(n);n.x=x;n.y=y;n.resize(w,h);n.cornerRadius=r;n.fills=[sol(fill)];n.strokes=[];return n;}\nfunction plus(parent,size,color){\n  const t=figma.createFrame();parent.appendChild(t);t.resize(size,size);t.fills=[];t.strokes=[];t.name=\"Plus\";\n  const bar=Math.round(size*0.16), len=size;\n  const a=R(t,0,0,len,bar,bar/2,color);a.x=0;a.y=(size-bar)/2;\n  const b=R(t,0,0,bar,len,bar/2,color);b.x=(size-bar)/2;b.y=0;\n  return t;\n}\n// 1) Combo component: replace heart glyph text with real Icon_Heart instance\nconst combo=ws.findOne(n=>n.type===\"COMPONENT\"&&n.name===\"ProductCard/Combo\");\nconst heart=combo.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Heart\");\nheart.children.slice().forEach(c=>{try{c.remove();}catch(e){}});\nconst hi=(await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(\"2:78\")).createInstance();\nheart.appendChild(hi);hi.resize(16,15);hi.x=7;hi.y=8;hi.name=\"Icon_Heart\";\ntry{hi.findAll(n=>n.type===\"VECTOR\").forEach(v=>{v.strokes=[sol(C.brand)];v.fills=[];});}catch(e){}\n// 2) Row card plus: make it clearly visible\nconst rowC=ws.findOne(n=>n.type===\"COMPONENT\"&&n.name===\"ProductCard/Row\");\nconst rowAdd=rowC.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Add\");\nrowAdd.children.slice().forEach(c=>{try{c.remove();}catch(e){}});\nconst pl=plus(rowAdd,14,C.white); pl.x=9; pl.y=9;\n\n// 3) Restore per-instance text in 04_Home\nconst home=ws.findOne(n=>n.name===\"04_Home\"&&n.type===\"FRAME\");\nconst combos=home.findAll(n=>n.type===\"INSTANCE\"&&n.name===\"ProductCard/Combo\");\nconst data=[[\"Honey lime combo\",\"₦2,000\"],[\"Berry mango combo\",\"₦8,000\"]];\ncombos.forEach((c,i)=>{\n  const nm=c.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Name\"); const pr=c.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Price\");\n  if(nm) nm.characters=data[i][0];\n  if(pr) pr.characters=data[i][1];\n});\n// verify reactions\nconst frames=ws.children.filter(n=>n.type===\"FRAME\"&&/^\\d\\d_/.test(n.name));\nconst reactions=frames.map(f=>({name:f.name,frame:f.reactions.length,\n  children:f.findAll(n=>n.reactions && n.reactions.length>0).map(n=>n.name)}));\nreturn JSON.stringify(reactions).slice(0,2000);","description":"Fix combo card hearts/add buttons, restore instance text, verify reactions","fileKey":"5I7PlvtoC7GX1zbReFo1tr","skillNames":"figma-use"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3202,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":130145,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3202}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"699ed9aa-c6dd-440c-b26c-c32602e1a158","uuid":"de0d671d-6970-49e3-97e8-bfa3b7aab0b3","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:33:41.407Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01kMTm8gFiE2XSV6iplqJoMd","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
